@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor<<service>> #E8F8E8
  BorderColor<<service>> #4CAF50
  BackgroundColor<<gateway>> #E3F2FD
  BorderColor<<gateway>> #2196F3
  BackgroundColor<<broker>> #FFF3E0
  BorderColor<<broker>> #FF9800
  BackgroundColor<<db>> #FFEBEE
  BorderColor<<db>> #F44336
  BackgroundColor<<cache>> #F3E5F5
  BorderColor<<cache>> #9C27B0
  BackgroundColor<<client>> #E8F5E8
  BorderColor<<client>> #2E7D32
}

component [WebApp] <<client>>
component [Customer Management API] <<service>>
component [Vehicle Management API] <<service>>
component [Workshop Management API] <<service>>

component [Auditlog Service] <<service>>
component [Invoice Service] <<service>>
component [Notification Service] <<service>>
component [Time Service] <<service>>
component [Workshop Management Event Handler] <<service>>

component [RabbitMQ] <<broker>>
database [SQL Server] <<db>>
component [MailDev] <<service>>
component [Seq] <<service>>

WebApp --> [Customer Management API] : HTTP/REST
WebApp --> [Vehicle Management API] : HTTP/REST
WebApp --> [Workshop Management API] : HTTP/REST

[Customer Management API] --> RabbitMQ : Publish Events
[Vehicle Management API] --> RabbitMQ : Publish Events
[Workshop Management API] --> RabbitMQ : Publish Events

RabbitMQ -.-> [Auditlog Service] : Event Subscription
RabbitMQ -.-> [Invoice Service] : Event Subscription
RabbitMQ -.-> [Notification Service] : Event Subscription
RabbitMQ -.-> [Workshop Management Event Handler] : Event Subscription

[Time Service] --> RabbitMQ : Publish DayHasPassed

[Customer Management API] --> [SQL Server] : JDBC
[Vehicle Management API] --> [SQL Server] : JDBC
[Workshop Management API] --> [SQL Server] : JDBC
[Invoice Service] --> [SQL Server] : JDBC
[Notification Service] --> [SQL Server] : JDBC
[Workshop Management Event Handler] --> [SQL Server] : JDBC

[Invoice Service] --> MailDev : SMTP
[Notification Service] --> MailDev : SMTP

[Customer Management API] --> Seq : Logging
[Vehicle Management API] --> Seq : Logging
[Workshop Management API] --> Seq : Logging
[Auditlog Service] --> Seq : Logging
[Invoice Service] --> Seq : Logging
[Notification Service] --> Seq : Logging
[Time Service] --> Seq : Logging
[Workshop Management Event Handler] --> Seq : Logging
@enduml